title: "Q-Crypto Evolve"
abstract: "Research laboratory for hybrid post-quantum cryptography with QKD key delivery (ETSI GS QKD 014) and a TLS 1.3 bridge using the delivered key as an external PSK. Written by an AI (Claude, Anthropic) under verification gates; no external human review. Not for production use."
